{"ancestors": "0,9021399,9021400", "bizKey": "9021402", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-11-17 16:55:31", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p><br></p><p>目前常见的环氧塑封料的主要组成为填充料（70％～90％）、环氧树脂（18％以下）、固化剂（9％以下）、添加剂（3％~7%左右）。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/0268da85-b9dc-4222-8967-733916421a9f-1700212241353.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 392.00px;height: 297.43px;\"/></p><p>从下游环氧塑封料生产企业成本角度来看，以华海诚科为例，环氧树脂采购金额排名第一。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/7b853554-d5a3-4338-82df-94d45136fc50-1700212279600.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p><p><br></p>", "firstLetter": "HYSZ", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 1, "name": "环氧树脂", "parentId": 9021400, "pctChg": 0.33, "reason": "环氧树脂占环氧塑封料采购金额的38.20%，成本排名第一（酚醛树脂格局类似）", "remark": "", "sort": 2, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9021402, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-11-17 17:18:49"}
